**What are AI coding assistants?**
AI coding assistants are smart software tools that use large language models to help people write, fix, and understand computer code. 
They work inside text editors or terminal windows to provide real-time suggestions, complete full lines of code, and turn plain text instructions into working scripts

**Core FeaturesCode Completion:**
Predicts and writes the next lines of code as you type.
Natural Language Translation: Turns normal written sentences into functional code blocks.
Debugging & Refactoring: Finds errors, fixes bugs, and cleans up old code.
Explanation: Breaks down hard-to-understand code or project setups into simple terms.

**Common Types:**
Editor Extensions: Tools built right into your workspace like GitHub Copilot or Cursor that help with local context and chat.
Terminal & Agentic Tools: Advanced systems like Claude Code that can read whole project folders, run commands, and edit multiple files at once.
